sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Customer
    participant API as Shopping / Food API
    participant Inv as Inventory Engine
    participant DB as MongoDB (Products/Orders)
    participant Ledger as RFC 8785 Audit Ledger

    Customer->>API: POST /shopping/orders (item_id, qty=2, Idempotency-Key)
    API->>API: Discard client-submitted prices & calculate integer paise
    
    API->>Inv: Atomic Stock Decrement
    Inv->>DB: update_one({_id: prod_id, stock: {$gte: 2}}, {$inc: {stock: -2}})
    alt Stock Insufficient
        DB-->>Inv: Modified Count = 0
        Inv-->>API: Insufficient Stock Error
        API-->>Customer: 400 Bad Request (Item Out of Stock)
    else Stock Reserved
        DB-->>Inv: Modified Count = 1
        Inv-->>API: Stock Reserved
    end

    API->>DB: Insert Order Record (status: "pending", total_paise)
    DB-->>API: Order Saved (order_id)

    API->>Ledger: Append Event (type="order.created", actor=pseudonym, order_id)
    Ledger-->>API: Event Chained (SHA-256)

    API-->>Customer: 201 Created (order_id, status: "pending", total_paise)

    Note over Customer,Ledger: Order Cancellation & Stock Restoration
    Customer->>API: POST /shopping/orders/{id}/cancel
    API->>DB: Verify Ownership (user_id == current_user)
    API->>DB: Update order status to "cancelled"
    API->>DB: Restore stock {$inc: {stock: +2}}
    API->>Ledger: Append Event (type="order.cancelled", order_id)
    API-->>Customer: 200 OK (Order Cancelled & Stock Restored)
